  "name": "Broccoli, lentil and mushroom plate",
  "description": "A soy-free plate for lunch or dinner: broccoli and mushrooms charred in dry pans, stirred through warm cooked lentils with wilted spinach, finished with sunflower seeds and basil.",
  "iconKey": "fork_knife",
  "instructions": [
    "Set two wide non-stick pans over high heat, divide the mushrooms and the broccoli between them in a single layer and leave them undisturbed for 3 minutes so they char rather than steam.",
